SUMMARY:2nd Friday ArtAbout at the Pence Gallery
DESCRIPTION:2nd Friday ArtAbout at the Pence Gallery in Davis \nFriday\, September 11\, 6-9 PM (Free) \n  \nJoin us at the Pence Gallery for the opening reception of Art Auction 2026! This spectacular display of art features work by 100+ local & regional artists. Preview sculptures\, paintings\, photography\, textiles\, and more on display at the Pence\, as well as online for silent auction bidding at bit.ly/penceartauction. Also\, enjoy complimentary wine and an art-themed scavenger hunt at the Pence during the 2nd Friday ArtAbout. Complete all of the clues by exploring our exhibit for the chance to win a special prize. \n  \nThe Art Auction is on display from September 5th-26th. Bidding opens online at midnight on Sept. 5th and closes at 8 PM PST on Sept. 26th. \n  \n— \n  \nVisit the Pence and other venues in Downtown Davis for the 2nd Friday ArtAbout artwalk. We will have printed ArtAbout guides available that week. Follow the ArtAbout’s Facebook page for more information: https://www.facebook.com/davisartabout. \n  \nImages: \nMarsha Godoy Schindler\, “Grounded” (detail) \nBeth Savidge\, “Allium” (detail) \nMohamed Abdelbaki\, “Cache Creek” (detail) \nAmy Teutemacher\, “Urban Mosaic” (detail)
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/2nd-friday-artabout-at-the-pence-gallery-17/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Pence-Reception-Banners-1-1-g8PbzN.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
